	quest.00577572C8BBF051.quest_desc: [
		"&#a10000GA: Let me c☠ver \"Gates\" f☠r y☠u, first then."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: There are three types you must c☠ncern y☠urself with. The first will take you s☠mewhere y☠u've never been bef☠re at an entirely different l☠cation ☠n your land. Useful f☠r s☠me."
