		"&#a10000GA: The second, a direct line t☠ y☠ur client player. I used to use these to visit Maramm whenever I was ☠verwhelmed with my resp☠nsibilities within the Medium. G☠☠d times."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/gates width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"&#a10000GA: Lastly, there are \"Return N☠des\" acr☠ss y☠ur land. If y☠u're l☠st s☠mewhere, l☠☠k f☠r ☠ne ☠f these t☠ take y☠u back h☠me. That is all."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/return_node width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"&#a10000GA: Until next we speak,"
		""
		"&#a10000GA: -Grymla"
	]
