	]
	quest.2FC4997B31CF3C8A.title: "&#71274funderstanding the soul."
	quest.30EB4866AA0E03FB.quest_desc: [
		"&7>&r In order to breed a successful, healthy, and genetically bountiful &zGENESIS FROG&r, you must modify its DNA with 4 core pillars that demonstrate your personal development of playing &aSBURB&r."
		""
		"&7>&r See the following pages."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&bTechnology&r has allowed civilization to flourish across every universe; acting as a bridge between abstract physical laws and the survival of the people that abide by them. A healthy &zGenesis Frog&r should be equipped with the genetic code necessary to facilitate such innovation in it's inhabitants. Genetically modifying it's code using &bT3CHN-0.ska&r should work."
		"{image:kubejs:item/techusb width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&#D419FF&lMagic is real. &rTherefore, a healthy &zGenesis Frog&r should contain a good amount of &#D419FFmagic&r. Genetically modifying it's code using &#D419FFM4G-1C.ska&r should work."
		"{image:kubejs:item/magicusb width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&cAlchemy&r is an essential part in expressing one's freedom and allowing a universe to contain an infinite amount of possible things. Genetically modifying a &zGenesis Frog&r's genetic code using &c4LCH3M-1Z3.ska&r should ensure alchemy works in your new universe."
		"{image:kubejs:item/alchemizeusb width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&zAdventure&r is an essential ingredient in the fabric of a universe. Gathering experiences, making memories and encoding this into the Genetic Code of your &zGenesis Frog&r will be essential."
		"{image:kubejs:item/explorationusb width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.30EB4866AA0E03FB.title: "&aFOUR PILLARS OF &zGENESIS"
