	quest.37281CD21D22D4A9.title: "[010] ULTIMATE GUIDE TO PLUSHES IN SBURB"
	quest.372FCB957A5EBCA1.quest_desc: [
		"&7> &rOnce you are completely satisfied with the &zVERSES&r you have, you can begin the process of birthing your &zGENESIS FROG&r and travelling to it via a LINKED HYPERBOOK."
		""
		"&7> &rYou can birth your universe using any cauldron, but one is available, as well as a lectern to place your linked hyperbook, at the &lVICTORY PLATFORM&r. Upon completing the process, the &zGENESIS TADPOLE&r will travel to the BA&8TT&rLE&8FI&rEL&8D&r to grow, so you can only enter your universe using the hyperbook."
		""
		"&7> &rThe cauldron must be &eHEATED&r and filled with &9WATER&r. Then, the following items must be placed inside:"
		""
		"- All chosen &zVERSES&r to modify different aspects of your universe"
		"- 32 &aGENETIC CODE&r"
		"- a &2WRITTEN BOOK&r to complete the birthing process (throw this in last)"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/frogassembly width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.372FCB957A5EBCA1.title: "&aBirthing the &zUniverse"
