	quest.3782F529E0BBE336.quest_desc: [
		"&#a10000GA: I have a selfish request for you, if I may."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: This land has s☠mething waiting for y☠u. In s☠me ☠f th☠se \"Time Dungeons\" ☠f y☠urs, ☠r rarely carried by underlings, y☠u can find my writings from back when I was in the medium as y☠u are. "
		""
		"&#a10000GA: Assessments of myself and my c☠mrades. I don't recall who tasked me to write them, anym☠re."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: I w☠uld like you to retrieve them f☠r me, if you can."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: It... W☠uld mean a lot t☠ me, if y☠u c☠uld."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: Thank you. That is all."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: Until next we speak,"
		""
		"&#a10000GA: -Grymla"
	]
