	quest.412294E0412E3119.quest_desc: [
		"&3Create&r allows you to build interactive machinery to move and process items and interact with the world around you via technology. In order to craft &bT3CHN-0.ska&r, you must create a &3Precision Mechanism&r and a &3Sturdy Sheet&r."
