	quest.41F0817FECFB5587.quest_desc: [
		"&bCruxite&r is a foundational material for the game of &aSBURB&r. It is needed for crafting many parts and machines, and to make more captchalogue cards."
		""
		"&aUranium&r powers most &aSburb&r machinery. It contains energy sufficient to last generations."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7P.S.&r Did you know you can crawl, sit and roll?"
		""
		"&aZ&r to crawl (hold)"
		"&aSHIFT + Z&r to sit (toggle)"
		"&aSHIFT + R to roll&r, giving 0.4 seconds of &ainvulnerability&r. You can roll midair."
		""
		"You can add more emotes by pressing &aU&r and adding them to the Emote Wheel."
	]
