		"&#7700ffBJ: hey there :)"
		""
		"&#7700ffBJ: looks like youre a mind player. i knew i liked you :)"
		""
		"&#7700ffBJ: you tend to think things through. or atleast try to. :)"
		""
		"&#7700ffBJ: im sure we'll do well together. follow along :)"
		"-- &#7700ffBJ&r Closed Memo --"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&3“Those bound to the aspect of Mind are-you guessed it-the universe's great thinkers. But don't for a second think that means that they have all the answers. They are very concerned with remaining rational, and they have such a firm hold on the constant conjunction of their thinking that it's easy for them to see the multitudes of the choices laid out before them, which often leaves them frozen and unable to act. That said, when a Mind-bound finally launches into action, they can execute a plan with unbelievable grace and precision. Their identity is fluid-it can change from day-to-day, from thought-to-thought, from interaction-to-interaction. Remaining logical is more important to them than building up a solid foundation of \"self.\" At their best they are great innovators, architects, and creators. At their worst they can be nasty, inflexible, and indecisive.”"
		"&3— The Extended Zodiac"
	]
	quest.42CBA5713E40A4FE.title: "&#7700ffTherefore I Am"
	quest.43F7BF7B8B2964B9.quest_desc: [
		"As you may have noticed, your inventory is &aLARGELY INACCESSIBLE&r at the moment. All you have access to currently is some bare minimum pocket space."
		""
		"Need to store extra items? The &aSYLLADEX&r is here to help! Based on different data structures and games, these handy inventory systems allow players to captchalogue items into &aCAPTCHALOGUE CARDS&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"To switch your modus, open the menu with G, place the modus inside the slot, and click 'Use Item'."
		""
		"To captchalogue an item, press X while holding it."
		""
		"To quick-access your sylladex, press H. You can retrieve the item with a left click, or retrieve the card holding the item with a right click."
	]
