	quest.5BD524AB703124C5.quest_desc: ["Throwing the Rings into the &8Forge&r (the large volcano in the middle of &bSkaia&r) stokes it. This heats up the planets core, making it hospitable for an eventual &zGenesis Frog&r to grow inside Skaia's core."]
