	quest.5F481D0B2AD41974.title: "&#7700ffEcne :|"
	quest.5F7D17F500856E92.quest_desc: [
		"-- &#bf9000ferocious(xeriscape) f(X)&r has created the memo &#bf9000ITS-LOVELY-TO-MEET-YOU&r --"
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): annyeong~?♪ is this thing on~?♪"
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): ah, there you are~!!♪"
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): its so lovely to finally meet you! my name is shonne, but my fans call me seungwannie~<3♪ "
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): im going to be giving you a hand in this place~!!!♪"
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): dont be scared!! you and i have the same thing that guides us... hope~!!!♪"
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): ill be in touch~!♪"
		""
		"-- &#bf9000f(x)&r Closed Memo --"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&e“Those bound to the aspect of Hope are driven first and foremost by their convictions. They do right for right's sake, and are quick to come to the aid of anyone they deem to be experiencing injustice. That said, their views of the world can be quite black and white, so what they see as the \"right\" thing may not always be the universally accepted view. They put great value in the power of the imagination, the ability to dream up a better and more beautiful future. If anyone could dream a better world into existence, it would be one of the Hope-bound. They may sound like all sunshine and rainbows, but they aren't adverse to a little destruction, especially if they think they can replace it with something better and more just. At their best, Hope-bound are positive, caring, and warm. At their worst they can be narrow-minded and selfish.”"
		"&e— The Extended Zodiac"
	]
	quest.5F7D17F500856E92.title: "&#bf9000The World's Stage~♪"
	quest.5F9AD24D26B5A87D.quest_desc: [
		"&#069a97TK: ¶ Those bounδ to chasing luck often finδ themselves the most unlucky. You must remove the luck from this lanδ, player."
		""
		"&#069a97TK: ¶ In your lanδ there are many slot machines. Go finδ them. Bring some δiamonds."
		""
		"&#069a97TK: ¶ By the way, consiδer your initiation to Delta Xi Delta finisheδ. Welcome. My name is Prytan of course, Prytan Harvuδ, the leaδer of... well it δoesn't exist anymore... but you get the point."
		""
		"&#069a97TK: ¶ You're welcome."
	]
	quest.5F9AD24D26B5A87D.title: "&#069a97¶ Feeling Lucky?"
	quest.5FFA4471251A0BEF.title: "Verse Choosing"
	quest.605E6918374B775A.quest_subtitle: "One who serves their ASPECT or serves through their ASPECT"
	quest.605E6918374B775A.title: "Maid"
	quest.6074B98C4B93596D.title: "&dSUPREME"
	quest.60A6FBAAF34FCED7.quest_desc: [
		"&#009f4fPY: I've been looking over Your planet and I alreadY know what's wrong with it. You're welcome <3. I'll tell You later. If You're nice."
		""
		"&#009f4fPY: Now, gates. Your first gate leads off to some part of Your land You haven't seen. TrY to look presentable. It's not WednesdaY, You don't have to wear pink.~"
		""
		"&#009f4fPY: The second one goes to &aYour client plaYer's house&#009f4f. Do knock first, it's onlY polite. Unlike some people.~"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/gates width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"&#009f4fPY: And whenever You'd like to go home, use a return node. TheY're scattered all over Your planet, so even You can't miss them. ProbablY.~"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/return_node width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.60A6FBAAF34FCED7.title: "&#009f4fBeginning Your Quest"
	quest.612429FF6E98B61B.quest_desc: [
		"-- &#069a97tortfeasorsKatabasis [TK]&r has created the memo DELTA_XI_DELTA_INITIATION --"
		"&#069a97TK: ¶ Wow."
		""
		"&#069a97TK: ¶ Just wow."
		""
		"&#069a97TK: ¶ Watching you fumble of those last few machines maδe me retch, and I δon't even δo that δuδe."
		""
		"&#069a97TK: ¶ Whatever. We'll work on your timing and clearly wiggler level understanδing of the game soon enough."
		""
		"&#069a97TK: ¶ You're a light player. As am I. Anδ that means fortune is always on our siδe."
		""
		"&#069a97TK: ¶ Training begins now."
		"-- &#069a97TK&r Closed Memo --"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6“Those bound to the aspect of Light are the universe's knowledge-seekers. They are, above all, driven to learn and understand. They are great alchemists, able to take multiple sources of information and synthesize them into something useful. They are scholars and researchers, absolutely dedicated to knowledge for knowledge's sake. They are the ultimate students, and although that might conjure up the image of people sitting around peacefully waiting for knowledge to be brought to them, that couldn't be further from the truth. The Light-bound will go after knowledge with a fierce intensity that others may find distasteful. They aren't overly concerned with laws or norms, either. They often take rules as simple suggestions, instead searching for loopholes or work-arounds. At their best, the Light-bound are resourceful and driven. At their worst they can be fussy, pedantic, and insensitive.”"
		"&6— The Extended Zodiac"
	]
	quest.612429FF6E98B61B.title: "&#069a97¶ Fortune's Favor"
	quest.6131DA533D637434.quest_desc: [
		"&#a10000GA: Thank y☠u. Sincerely, thank y☠u. Reading them again... I w☠nder h☠w many things I c☠uld've d☠ne differently?"
		""
		"&#a10000GA: I will spare you my w☠es. F☠r n☠w, I understand y☠u seek g☠dh☠☠d, c☠rrect? D☠ing so will all☠w y☠u c☠uncil with Cait-Sith."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: It's a dangerous game, divinity. I've seen it c☠nsume many different versi☠ns ☠f myself wh☠le. But, I've seen en☠ugh ☠f y☠u t☠ trust y☠u will find a path thr☠ugh. I kn☠w y☠u can."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: The echeladder is the first step, reach the rung ☠f \"&9Divine Delegate&#a10000\", and then make y☠ur way t☠ y☠ur lands quest bed - a large red structure with a bed on t☠p."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: It is there that you must relinquish y☠ur m☠rtality. I'd suggest sparing y☠ur other players a lifes w☠rth of murder-induced-mental-anguish and d☠ing the j☠b yourself."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: I get the feeling ☠ur time together is c☠ming to an end. Please, assure a universe we never c☠uld. That is all."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: Until next we speak,"
		""
		"&#a10000GA: -Grymla"
	]
	quest.6131DA533D637434.title: "&#a10000Ascensi☠n"
	quest.617050CEFA6AB3A5.quest_subtitle: "One who manipulates their ASPECT or manipulates through their ASPECT"
	quest.617050CEFA6AB3A5.title: "Witch"
	quest.6458E254AE0374C7.quest_desc: ["{image:kubejs:item/ecto5 width:100 height:100 align:center}"]
	quest.6458E254AE0374C7.quest_subtitle: "This data is required for &zULTIMATE ALCHEMY&r."
	quest.6458E254AE0374C7.title: "&z3XPL-0R3.ska"
	quest.64591BF974FF0F4A.quest_desc: [
		"-- &#71274fdevotionDevours&r [DD] has created the memo &#71274fHIYA&r --"
		""
		"&#71274fDD: hiya mate."
		""
		"&#71274fDD: so heres. the deal."
		""
		"&#71274fDD: u need me."
		""
		"&#71274fDD: naebdy else. is coming. tae help."
		""
		"&#71274fDD: take it. or leave it. haha."
		""
		"&#71274fDD: see ya soon."
		""
		"-- &#71274f[DD]&r Closed Memo --"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&d“Those bound to the aspect of Heart are very concerned with their favorite subject: themselves. It wouldn't be a stretch to call them 'self-obsessed', but not necessarily in a negative way. They simply want to understand the one thing we all are stuck with for our entire lives, i.e. our own minds. Forging an identity is extremely important to the Heart-bound, and every decision and action goes toward building a coherent narrative of their own story. That isn't to say Heart-bound don't care deeply for their friends and allies; they just have a tendency to assume that everyone is as concerned with identity as they are. They are excellent at putting on and taking off masks as the situation calls for them. At their best, they are competent, imaginative, and steady. At their worst they can be overbearing, inflexible, and cold.”"
		"&d— The Extended Zodiac"
	]
	quest.64591BF974FF0F4A.quest_subtitle: "Enter the Medium as a Hero of Heart"
	quest.64591BF974FF0F4A.title: "&#71274fTo End All Suffering"
