	quest.6F5C0D5AC6937001.title: "&dCalm Down Bro"
	quest.6F74DCDD9623DF7B.quest_desc: [
		"It just so happens that today, they will embark on a journey of EPIC PROPORTION."
		""
		"First, they observed the &5Destiny Charting &rchapter, selecting their &aTitle&r and &eLunar&r &dSway&r. This is REQUIRED."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"A &aTitle&r is representative of your &6personality&r and the &ehero's journey&r you will go on. There are 12 aspects and 12 classes, making a total of 144 possible titles to choose from. Unsure which to pick? &bThe Internet&r or the &3Quest Description&r can help; or just pick one that sounds cool."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"A &eLunar&r &dSway &ris also dependant on one's &6personality&r. The &bInternet&r or observing the Moon's Quest itself can help to discover information about it. Choose either the &eKingdom of Light&r or the &5Kingdom of Darkness&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You can change your mind on your &aTitle&r and &eLunar&r &dSway&r and choose differently, however please do not do this after installing &2Sburb&r."
	]
	quest.6F74DCDD9623DF7B.quest_subtitle: "A young player stands in the &2Overworld&r."
	quest.6F74DCDD9623DF7B.title: "&7> &rEnter Name"
	quest.7013E9C78DEE3133.quest_desc: [
		"A necessary part of &aSburb&r is connecting to another disk running the game. 1 disk is the &aserver&r, and 1 is the &aclient&r."
		""
		"Any server can open to clients, and anyone with a client disk can connect to servers that are open if they don't already have a server. Thus, you can form a &achain&r of players connecting to each other using their own Server and Client disks. You can also connect to yourself."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/1player width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/2players width:100 height:100 align:center click_action:none:}"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/4players width:100 height:100 align:center click_action:none:}"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/12players width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&aSkin Credits&r:"
		"John:"
		"[ { \"text\": \"roxichu\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"open_url\", \"value\": \"https://www.planetminecraft.com/skin/john-egbert-homestuck-64x/\" } } ]"
		"Rose:"
		"[ { \"text\": \"girl_liker\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"open_url\", \"value\": \"https://www.planetminecraft.com/skin/rose-lalonde-6257322/\" } } ]"
		"Jade:"
		"[ { \"text\": \"Flutterfly103\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"open_url\", \"value\": \"https://www.planetminecraft.com/skin/jade-harley-5302500/\" } } ]"
		"Dave:"
		"[ { \"text\": \"KaiWasHere6175\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"open_url\", \"value\": \"https://www.planetminecraft.com/skin/dave-strider-6990033/\" } } ]"
		"Aradia, Sollux, Karkat, Nepeta, Kanaya, Vriska:"
