		"&#7700ffBJ: your second one goes to &ayour client players house&#7700ff :) i know where that is too :)"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/gates width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"&#7700ffBJ: return nodes take you home :) theyre all over your planet :)"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/return_node width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7CB4D6D9490C1722.title: "&#7700ffBeginning Your Quest :)"
	quest.7D0D840B916AB72B.quest_desc: [
		"&7=================================&r"
		"&7by &rjesterJudge"
		"&7=================================&r"
	]
	quest.7D0D840B916AB72B.title: "[018] can i beat the game with yarn only? (glitchless)"
	quest.7DD63E991CEE6EA2.quest_desc: [
		"&#82ab70ST: thiθ requeθt iθ double barreled, im helping you and Myθelf!!"
		""
		"&#82ab70ST: ur gonna have a lot of θcary thingθ going on in ur future... and for that, i think itθ for the beθt you be adequately prepared!!!"
		""
		"&#82ab70ST: i had heard ruMourθ about these θuper powerful weapons, all of which were deθcribed to me aθ \"zilly\". thiθ, i thought, θounded AWEθOME!!!!"
		""
		"&#82ab70ST: θo hereθ the deal, back at hoMe i was a little bit of a hoarder......and just.......back when that was what i did i wouldve loved to see a weapon like that!!! θo pleaθe, do me a θolid and make one....?"
		""
		"&#82ab70ST: itθ worth it for you too!! i θwear!! theyre like θuper θuper Mega θtrong!!!"
		""
		"&#82ab70ST: letθ θee... i θwear it waθ in one of gryMlaθ bookθ θomewhere... ah!! here we go!!!"
		""
		"&#82ab70ST: find θome θuθpiciouθ θand (suspicious sand, my quirk, lol), gather zilly duθt, turn it into soMe zilly chunks, then turn thoθe into a zilly geM, then alcheMize theM with a weapon!!!!"
		""
		"&#82ab70ST: i loved thiθ part of the game! i waθ θtrong enough to do what i wanted, and thingθ werent quite so hard!"
		""
		"&#82ab70ST: yeah...! i Mean, i waθ θtrong but.... not θtrong enough to have the power to Make the deciθionθ i didnt want to Make juθt yet. i had an excuθe to... not? i procraθtinated forever when i got to this point..."
		""
		"&#82ab70ST: i think.... i think when i look back.....?"
		""
		"&#82ab70ST: thoθe really were the happieθt days of my life"
	]
	quest.7DD63E991CEE6EA2.title: "&#82ab70letθ get zilly!"
	quest.7E2458E13D350BB2.quest_desc: [
		"It is &ahighly recommended&r to place your Computer at your home."
		""
		"Using completed &2Sburb Code&r on a computer gives the data necessary to burn the game &aSburb&r onto an empty disk."
		""
		"Once you've installed the disks, you can change your &zchat color&r and &adesktop theme&r if you'd like."
		""
		"&7================================="
		"&aMultiplayer &7-"
		"Using your &9Post Box&r, you can mail completed &aSburb Code&r to your friends' &6Mailbox&r so that they can burn the game onto their empty disks as well."
		"&7================================="
	]
	quest.7E2458E13D350BB2.title: "&7>&r Install"
	quest.7ECE66B2E1897EAC.quest_desc: [
		"&6&oYou must be hungry. I've left a cake in your kitchen for you to enjoy when you can."
		""
		"&6&oNow, there are dangerous times ahead, Your Highness. The Kingdom of Light requires your assistance. Please enjoy your food if you wish, and respond hastily to my subsequent correspondence."
	]
	quest.7ECE66B2E1897EAC.title: "&6For The King!"
	quest.7EE5BE85AAE29DEB.title: "&5𝄞 BRO IS A SONGWRITER"
	quest.7F1F654B3201E0D5.quest_desc: [
		"&#bf9000f(x): ive just had a fantastic idea~!♪"
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): it isnt good enough to just be their inspiration, we need to give them the capabilities to inspire themselves~!♪"
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): give a record deal to a consort! when you do, theyll join your band and perform with you~!♪"
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): yes, this must be just what they need! perhaps what we've been lacking is \"relatability\"~!♪"
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): my old group, rust velvet, we were all lowblood idols, which made us pretty popular among the sancturies without too much highblood presence~!♪"
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): not to imply we were some revolutionary pop-punk band, we were just an idol group~...♪"
		""
		"&#bf9000f(x): sighhhh.... those really were the days~♪"
	]
	quest.7F1F654B3201E0D5.title: "&#bf9000musicians of the land~♪"
	quest.7F6011CEE2E87041.quest_desc: ["[&cWARNING&r] It is recommended that you gather all materials, animals, or anything else you may need before continuing in &aSBURB&r. Having even 1 of something could still prove useful in your onward journey."]
	quest.7F6011CEE2E87041.title: "[&aS&r] Enter"
	quest.7FB825B517FCD319.quest_desc: [
		"&#a10000GA: Y☠u're fr☠m s☠mewhere with at least s☠me basic sense ☠f civility, right? "
		""
		"&#a10000GA: Assuming y☠u must be - th☠ugh with☠ut the certainty ☠f fact, given y☠u can't f☠rmulate resp☠nses to my mem☠s (Haha) - I will task y☠u with the m☠st fundamental task I c☠uld fath☠m; t☠ familiarise y☠urself with y☠ur aspect thr☠ugh s☠me g☠☠d ☠ld fashi☠ned, elb☠w greased, n☠se grind-st☠ned artisan work."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: Maramm accused me ☠f giving y☠u \"meaningless ch☠res\", but I assure you, this isn't even cl☠se to as menial a task as I c☠uld be pr☠viding. "
		""
		"&#a10000GA: If I wanted to talk myself ☠ut of believing y☠u're a l☠b☠t☠mite, I'd have y☠u make me s☠me c☠gs ☠r s☠mething."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: Anyway, ☠ff with you. That is all."
		""
		"&#a10000GA: Until next we speak,"
		""
		"&#a10000GA: -Grymla"
	]
	quest.7FB825B517FCD319.title: "&#a10000Sense of Time"
